# Partial BCD-to-seven-segment driver. Assumption: active-high segments; a and b are gate-level equations.
logic "BCD Seven-Segment Driver"
input A, B, C, D
output a, b, c, d, e, f, g
nA = NOT(A)
nB = NOT(B)
nC = NOT(C)
nD = NOT(D)
a1 = AND(nA, nB, nC)
a2 = AND(nA, B, nC, D)
a3 = AND(A, nB, C, D)
a = OR(a1, a2, a3)
b1 = AND(nA, nB, C, D)
b2 = AND(nA, B, nC, D)
b3 = AND(A, B, nC, D)
b = OR(b1, b2, b3)
c = BUF(A)
d = BUF(B)
e = BUF(C)
f = BUF(D)
g = OR(A, B)
